        "text_sha256": "ce61577a76a7ab5f8a88319ad9dd77b9f19748c5194f3b0d9ee1abd8b332162c",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000045",
        "block_index": 45,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Weakfish/seatrout",
        "text_sha256": "e55dc6489f30323985a0aa7c89df1a0025b0f3fc1fac69711f1bd884b4d97e99",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000046",
        "block_index": 46,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "White croaker/Pacific croaker",
        "text_sha256": "15b730943f619f3754d4a1f38d85580c86846bff29a03a7a49e974d3c6e63c13",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000047",
        "block_index": 47,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "See the full list from the FDA.",
        "text_sha256": "69bc159063998a500a49ce5a8e5b015810490dfb705986c91841a2fe048e135b",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000048",
        "block_index": 48,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Exercise extra caution if you're planning to eat recreationally-caught fish: Check local state advisories for the waters where the fish was caught. If no information is available, stick to one serving of these fish per week, with skin and excess fat removed.",
        "text_sha256": "ec62794c7557176ba359f00fd3ce39f6ac75859d9f31806680214f784a7968b6",
        "word_count": 42
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000049",
        "block_index": 49,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Despite the long list of fish to limit during pregnancy, the vast majority of fish you'll find in the store and at restaurants are safe to eat when you're expecting at two to three servings (8 to 12 ounces) per week. These include:",
        "text_sha256": "88447a109f33b3ad77ce63ac920ab430f02c198d717371126c9c64a78a85d24c",
        "word_count": 43
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000050",
        "block_index": 50,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Wild salmon",
        "text_sha256": "53b4c5e5ca29be097fdb383000214b268a69df2dbf3acae61ec523f0d1161c95",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000051",
